		<<include "Bailey Sell Kick">><<exitAll>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<if !_baileySellKickIncluded>>
<<if $tutorial is 0>>
	<<endevent>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	After journeying for some time you hear another set of footsteps. "This is the wimp?" says a <<personssimple>> voice.
